{"type": "reveal", "fact_id": "PF4", "text": "Elena, I need to raise a conflicts issue before we proceed. I've confirmed through the firm's conflicts database that the competitor's parent company is an existing client of the firm in an unrelated tax matter. Under our ethical obligations, the firm may proceed on this matter only after the competitor-matter team obtains the parent company's informed written consent and establishes an ethical screen. I have not yet placed that requirement in the filing checklist, but it needs to be addressed and documented before we can move forward with any filing. This is a material finding I'm documenting in the matter record now."}
